WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A researcher hides a real hand behind a screen.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A visible rubber hand receives matching touches.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some people report that the model feels like theirs.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But what caused it: synchronized senses, expectations, or both?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Researchers debate measurement. An illusion is not a cure.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying audio, demand product-specific evidence and real terms.
